# Microsoft 365 Core
# Narrow routing set for the family workload: Teams, Microsoft 365 / Office,
# Outlook, OneDrive, SharePoint and authentication. It intentionally avoids a
# blanket DOMAIN-SUFFIX,microsoft.com so unrelated Microsoft services can follow FINAL.
# Primary reference: Microsoft 365 URL and IP address ranges (current worldwide list).

# Identity / authentication
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,microsoftonline.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,microsoftonline-p.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,msauth.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,msftauth.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,msftauthimages.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,msidentity.com
DOMAIN,login.live.com
DOMAIN,account.live.com

